Confirmed the live region was present but found it was duplicated with the cam button's `accessibilityHint` (same `L.camOffHint` string on both), causing a real double-announcement risk. Fixed by removing the redundant hint from the cam button in `mobile/src/live/LiveBottomBar.tsx`, leaving the live-region `Text` as the sole announcer. `tsc --noEmit` shows no new errors. RESULT written to `tasks/admin-queue/done/115-live-bottom-bar-cam-off-hint-RESULT.md`.
